{
  "summary": "Posting and scheduling move to Ayrshare (0.39.0). Settings \u2192 Posting takes the Ayrshare API key and the X app keys; each brand gets its own Ayrshare profile (Set up posting) and links its Instagram, Facebook, TikTok, YouTube and X on Ayrshare's page, opened in the brand's window with each login filled in. Videos post now or wait in the queue, which schedules them through Ayrshare into the next posting time (3 a day per account, times editable, automatic by default) and reads each post's state back from Ayrshare's history. Removed: the direct TikTok/YouTube/X/Meta APIs and OAuth, developer accounts, app-review tracking, the Setup tracker, and posting through upload pages in app windows.",
